5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Let's make sure we don't overstretch ourselves! I'm worried about how much time we spend helping companies hire. We need to know if we can actually find the talent they need.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,George,,"I agree we need a grounded perspective. I want to see if our past successes are as stable as we claim, specifically regarding customer loyalty.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"Oh, you're all so serious! But since we're playing adults, I want to know where our money is actually going and how we can get more if things get tight.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I have a big idea! We always get so stressed at the end of the quarter. I want to know why the numbers are so hard to check!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We need to be realistic about the timeline from investment to actual operation. I'm concerned about the hidden obstacles that delay the first customer's deployment.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@George, that's a good point, but if we can't staff the company, the customer loyalty won't even matter! Let's divide the research so we cover everything.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,George,,I'll handle the historical performance. It's better to look at the exits and the retention rates to see what actually works.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"I'll take the financial plumbing. I'm curious about our credit lines and those reserve accounts. We can't just keep spending without a plan, right?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,I'm going to be a detective! I'll look into the audit stuff and those independent checks. I bet I'll find out why we're all so tired every three months!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,I'll focus on the operational bottlenecks. I want to see the security review times and the actual delivery records of our holdings.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,Sounds like a plan! I'll take the human side of things. I'll check the recruiters' placement times and our adviser bench. We can't keep spending all our time on LinkedIn!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,George,,That seems comprehensive enough. Let's proceed with these assignments.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,Perfect. I'll see if we're actually as rich as we pretend to be or if we're just one bad quarter away from a crisis.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,Yay! I'm going to find the secret to making quarter-end a party instead of a nightmare!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,Agreed. Let's see if we can identify the patterns that cause these delays before we commit to the next seed.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
